message: "Please cite the accompanying paper for the constructions, logical-frame methods, and LP distance-search and certification method. Cite this repository additionally when using its implementation or proof data. See README.md for BibTeX and suggested attribution."
type: software
title: "regular-logical-frames: Constructions and Computational Proof Data"
authors:
