    given-names: Jong Yeon
    affiliation: "University of Illinois Urbana-Champaign; Korea Institute for Advanced Study"
abstract: "Group-valued quantum codes with explicit regular logical frames, efficient exhaustive distance certification using symmetry reduction and stabilizer-based pruning, finite proof certificates, independent checkers, and reproducible execution records."
repository-code: "https://github.com/yeon-lee/public-regular-logical-frames"
